@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@
+/*!
+ * \copy
+ *     Copyright (c)  1998, 2009 Paul E. Jones <paulej@packetizer.com>
+ *     All rights reserved.
+ *
+ *     Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
