+ *
+ * Remarks:
+ * This function is used to initialize the specification structures
+ * for functions <ippsFFTFwd_RToCCS_S16_S32_Sfs> and
+ * <ippsFFTInv_CCSToR_S32_S16_Sfs>. Memory for *pFFTSpec must be
